# Tiny Emerald Whelpling from the Dreaming Whelps of Swamp of Sorrows.
# Sources: items.json (Dreaming Whelp, 0.08% per kill, Classic drop data; its
# spawns); the world database (five-minute respawn, Classic data); Forever's
# client data (the whelpling does not bind, so it can be traded).

step Dreaming Whelps
  tip The Dreaming Whelps (levels 35-36) live in western Swamp of Sorrows, near the Deadwind Pass border. They drop it about once in 1,250 kills, and there are only a handful, back about every five minutes, so expect days of farming; it can be traded, so the Auction House may be quicker.
  collect 8498 @11.5,62.9              -- Dreaming Whelps
